[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあっ……はあっ……まさか火事とは……！\nあの火の勢いじゃ店はもうダメになっちまったか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huff... huff... A fire, of all things...! At this rate, the shop's done for..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、騎士どもの目を盗んで逃げるには\n都合がいい……！\u3000金だけ持ってさっさと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But it's the perfect chance to slip away from those knights...! Just grab the money and get out of here..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――見つけた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Found you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど。その通路の先が金庫になっているのね。\n自分から案内してくれるなんて、優しい盗人さんね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. So that passage leads to the vault. How kind of you to show us the way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前たちはうちの店の……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're the girls from my shop...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンタのやったことは全部調べがついてるよ！\n盗んだものでお金儲けなんて許せない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We know everything you've done! Making money off stolen goods—that's unforgivable!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なんのことだかな。第一、お前はいったい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I don't know what you're talking about. And who are you, anyway...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ある時は星誕の使者、またある時は錬金術士の護衛……\nしてその正体は！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sometimes a Star's Messenger, sometimes an alchemist's bodyguard... But my true identity is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナ王国騎士団所属、イザナ・ココシュカ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana Kokoschka, knight of the Lantarna Royal Order!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "き、騎士だと！？\u3000まさか、そっちの二人も……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-a knight?! Don't tell me those two are also..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちは違うわ。でも、最初からあなたのやっている\nことは知っていた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're not. But we've known what you were up to from the start."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そして、あなたが貯め込んでいるであろう大金を\n狙っていた。だから店に雇われてやったの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And we were after the fortune you've been hoarding. That's why we took jobs at your shop."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "金庫の場所だけが分からなかったのだけど、\nあなたはまんまと作戦に乗ってくれた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The only thing we didn't know was where the vault was. But you fell right into our trap."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、まさか。あの火事はお前たちの仕業なのか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait... You mean that fire was your doing?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "火事って……これのこと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fire? You mean this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわあっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahhh?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……大丈夫。熱くないから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It's fine. Not hot."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは錬金術で作った特製の道具。\n「偽物の炎」を生み出すための、ね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Special alchemical tool. Makes fake flames..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に火事を起こすわけにはいかないからねー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We couldn't actually start a real fire, obviously!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "煙が出ないのが難点だったのだけれど、\nそこはかわいい忍者さんが補ってくれたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The lack of smoke was a problem, but our adorable ninja friend helped with that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なかなかいい演出だったでしょう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quite the performance, wasn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "く……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Damn...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしてこんなことしたの？\nそのお金で、何をするつもりだったの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why did you do this? What were you planning to do with all that money?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺は……俺は、この金を元手に組織を作り上げる！\nそして、裏社会を牛耳る一大勢力になる……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... I was going to use this fortune to build an organization! To become a force that rules the underworld...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "かつての月影の会や、極夜の錬金党と同じようにな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just like the Moonlight Society and the Polar Night Alchemists before me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなこと……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can't...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……「同じように」、ね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...\"Just like,\" you say."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人の渇望は人それぞれ。\nでも、お前は下品が過ぎる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone has their own desires. But yours are utterly vulgar."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "安心なさい。痛くないようにしてあげるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry. I'll make sure it doesn't hurt."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわああああっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahhhhh!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "支配人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Manager"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わわわわ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa whoa whoa...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どう？\u3000気分は……って、\nもう気を失っちゃったかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How do you feel? Oh my, did he pass out already?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……無理よ、その程度の器では",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hopeless. You never had what it takes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に切ってない……よね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You didn't actually cut him... right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふふ。もちろん。\n聖夜に血は似合わないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hehe. Of course not. Blood doesn't suit the holy night."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……さっさと連れていこ。\nここ、湿気多くて嫌……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Let's just take him away. Too damp here..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]